@context
Feature: bira context

  Background:
    Given I run "bira init --name test-project"

  Scenario: Context shows project summary after init
    When I run "bira context"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output contains "test-project"
    And output contains "Ideas:"
    And output contains "Bugs:"
    And output contains "Features:"

  @json
  Scenario: Context --json returns structured output
    When I run "bira context --json"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output as JSON at path "$.project_name" equals "test-project"
    And output as JSON at path "$.ideas" exists
    And output as JSON at path "$.bugs" exists
    And output as JSON at path "$.features" exists

  @json
  Scenario: Context --json counts reflect zero entities after init
    When I run "bira context --json"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output as JSON at path "$.ideas" equals 0
    And output as JSON at path "$.bugs" equals 0
    And output as JSON at path "$.features" equals 0

  @json
  Scenario: Context reflects added entities
    Given I run "bira idea add test-idea"
    Given I run "bira bug create test-bug"
    Given I run "bira feature add test-feat"
    When I run "bira context --json"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output as JSON at path "$.ideas" equals 1
    And output as JSON at path "$.bugs" equals 1
    And output as JSON at path "$.features" equals 1

  Scenario: Context --full shows section headers
    Given I run "bira idea add some-idea"
    When I run "bira context --full"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output contains "test-project"
    And output contains "IDEAS ("
    And output contains "BUGS ("
    And output contains "FEATURES ("

  @json
  Scenario: Context --full --json shows counts and arrays
    Given I run "bira idea add full-idea"
    Given I run "bira bug create full-bug"
    When I run "bira context --full --json"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output as JSON at path "$.idea_count" exists
    And output as JSON at path "$.bug_count" exists
    And output as JSON at path "$.feature_count" exists
    And output as JSON at path "$.ideas" exists
    And output as JSON at path "$.bugs" exists
    And output as JSON at path "$.features" exists

